                                                "example_id": "51674fa3-e603-4375-9589-066dd674ff20",
                                                "sense_id": "596ea2bc-0324-3f5c-899e-fa25c3e74c43",
                                                "text": "[H]e […] by his overcarefulneſſe and cauſeleſſe ſuſpicion, deprived himſelf of this benefit, and implunged himſelf in much juſt hatred for his unjuſt dealing and treachery."
                                            },
